{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_738D59B0","title":"Interview Ma Gomba","entry":"Dlg_738D59B0::entry","exit":"Dlg_738D59B0::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_D29F8967","articyId":"72057791606428720","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"My favorite puffball. Always a pleasure.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My favorite puffball. Always a pleasure.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":100.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33051","byteOffset":20387488,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_9DDA274B","articyId":"72057791606428727","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Well, if it isn’t my least favorite stinkhorn. Still stunting everyone’s growth with your acidic principles?","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, if it isn’t my least favorite stinkhorn. Still stunting everyone’s growth with your acidic principles?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":100.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24776","byteOffset":17253216,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_AC71C4CC","articyId":"72057791606428749","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"And I have a few thoughts on why you are still shedding bacteria in my general vicinity.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And I have a few thoughts on why you are still shedding bacteria in my general vicinity.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37838","byteOffset":28650464,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_5D786E3C","articyId":"72057791606428756","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Fire away, I'm all ears.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Fire away, I'm all ears.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17704","byteOffset":14587072,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_0E598341","articyId":"72057791606428771","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Danetti… too sweet for my tastes. But a vigorous energy to him I admire. He’ll go far. If he heeds my advice.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Danetti… too sweet for my tastes. But a vigorous energy to him I admire. He’ll go far. If he heeds my advice.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50554","byteOffset":33466360,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_1294BFB6","articyId":"72057791606428785","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"I gave him a few… hints. A sprinkle of lion’s mane here, a dash of psilocybin there, the customers will come running.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I gave him a few… hints. A sprinkle of lion’s mane here, a dash of psilocybin there, the customers will come running.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30597","byteOffset":19455808,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_B89A7041","articyId":"72057791606428799","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"That is a concern. He and I have been working on something new together. I’d hate to see it fall into the wrong hands.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That is a concern. He and I have been working on something new together. I’d hate to see it fall into the wrong hands.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51786","byteOffset":34007600,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_FC4563BC","articyId":"72057791606428813","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Do you know how Curzona’s Third Branch fell? Someone adulterated the biscuit supply with a powerful cocktail of flavor enhancers, appetite inhibitors and mood boosters. The entire board ate themselves to death.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you know how Curzona’s Third Branch fell? Someone adulterated the biscuit supply with a powerful cocktail of flavor enhancers, appetite inhibitors and mood boosters. The entire board ate themselves to death.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50781","byteOffset":33550896,"byteLength":556}},{"id":"DFr_744A6C16","articyId":"72057791606428834","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"So believe me when I say, a donut is never just a donut. I would suggest you find who did this, and quickly. If not, the results could be messy.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So believe me when I say, a donut is never just a donut. I would suggest you find who did this, and 